  triage:title "Sprint AX.5 doc frontmatter still reads status: draft and all D1-D6 checkboxes are unchecked at the reviewed head" ;
  triage:description "AX.5 QA-1 (quality-mgr ax5-qa-r1, PR #1201 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T12:38Z) at head da823baaa0018933f8daac388733c51eb14e9335. req-qa ATM-QA-005 (also flagged by quality-mgr pre-dispatch): docs/plans/phase-ax/sprint-AX.5-task-reminder-cycle.md:8 reads status: draft and the D1-D6 checkboxes at :143-:199 are all unchecked although D1-D5 are independently verified functionally complete. This breaks the phase's deliverable-tracking convention (AX.1/AX.2/AX.4 flip to complete with checked boxes once QA-ready). Fix: set status to complete and check D1-D6 once D6 (tests) is delivered; keep the YAML frontmatter valid (parse with yaml.safe_load)." ;
